\item[S2] Fotis Iliopoulos and Alistair Sinclair, Efficiently List-Edge Coloring Multigraphs Asymptotically Optimally, arXiv:1812.10309v3 (2021), Section 1, list chromatic index and List Coloring Conjecture preceding Theorem 1.2. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/1812.10309v3}.
